From 4dc12a98d442c39d37cc9064199847bd20a7c16a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Machado?= <machaddr@falanet.org>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: boe: prepare PineTab-V DSI host first
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The TH101MB31IG002-28A controller used by PineTab-V requires the DSI
lanes to be in LP-11 before its reset sequence.  The driver tries to
establish LP-11 with a DCS no-op, but without prepare_prev_first that
transfer happens before the DSI bridge pre-enable callback.

The Cadence host therefore acquires and releases a temporary runtime PM
reference for every command.  On JH7110, releasing that reference powers
off and resets the external D-PHY, so LP-11 is not maintained across the
panel reset and initialization table.  This makes panel startup depend on
timing and can leave the backlight enabled without video.

Request host-first prepare ordering for the PineTab-V panel descriptor.
The Cadence bridge then holds its runtime PM reference, and the JH7110
D-PHY remains configured, throughout reset and panel initialization.
Leave the ordering unchanged for the other panels supported by this
driver.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
Signed-off-by: André Machado <machaddr@falanet.org>
---
 .../gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-th101mb31ig002-28a.c  | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-th101mb31ig002-28a.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-th101mb31ig002-28a.c
index 6dc24bf8fa34..b23d7307efb2 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-th101mb31ig002-28a.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-boe-th101mb31ig002-28a.c
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@ struct panel_desc {
 	unsigned int power_off_delay_ms;
 	unsigned int init_retries;
 	bool keep_powered_without_reset;
+	bool prepare_prev_first;
 };
 
 struct boe_th101mb31ig002 {
@@ -380,6 +381,7 @@ static const struct panel_desc pinetab_v_desc = {
 	.lp11_to_reset_delay_ms = 5,
 	.init_retries = 2,
 	.keep_powered_without_reset = true,
+	.prepare_prev_first = true,
 };
 
 static const struct drm_display_mode starry_er88577_default_mode = {
@@ -469,6 +471,7 @@ static int boe_th101mb31ig002_dsi_probe(struct mipi_dsi_device *dsi)
 	dsi->format = desc->format;
 	dsi->mode_flags = desc->mode_flags;
 	ctx->desc = desc;
+	ctx->panel.prepare_prev_first = desc->prepare_prev_first;
 
 	ctx->power = devm_regulator_get(&dsi->dev, "power");
 	if (IS_ERR(ctx->power))
-- 
2.55.0
